{"id":"P040-1","subject":"P","unit":"P040","unitTitle":"2024 상반기 · 24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P040-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n전기력선의 성질에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 전기력선은 서로 교차하지 않는다.\n\n② 정전하에서 시작하여 부전하에서 끝난다.\n\n③ 전기력선 밀도는 전계의 세기와 같다.\n\n④ 전기력선의 접선방향은 전계의 방향과 같다.\n\n⑤ 전기력선은 등전위면과 평행하다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1222}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n대전도체에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 대전도체의 내부전위는 표면전위와 같다.\n\n② 대전도체 내부의 전계는 0이다.\n\n③ 대전도체의 표면전하밀도는 곡률반경이 클수록 크다.\n\n④ 대전도체의 전하는 도체 표면에만 존재한다.\n\n⑤ 대전도체의 표면에서 전기력선은 수직으로 출입한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m02-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1834}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n그림과 같이 m, m 떨어진 각 지점 , , 에\n× C의 전하가 있을 때, 지점의 전하에 가해지는\n\n                                \n힘의 작용방향과 크기N 는? (단,    × 이다.)                                        \n\n\n\n\n\n① →의 방향으로, × N\n② →의 방향으로, × N\n③ →의 방향으로, × N\n④ →의 방향으로, × N\n⑤ →의 방향으로, × N","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":790},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m03-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n반지름이 cm인 도체구의 표면전하밀도가 × \nCm이기 위한 표면전위는 몇 V인가?\n\n      \n(단,    × 이다.)      \n\n\n①          ② \n\n③          ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":688},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m04-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1154}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n평행한 두 직선도체에 동일한 방향으로 전류가 흐를 때,\n\n두 도체 사이에 발생하는 힘의 종류는?\n\n\n① 흡인력        ② 반발력\n\n③ 회전력        ④ 인장력\n\n⑤ 마찰력","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m05-e1.webp","width":696,"height":728}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n무한장 직선도체에 흐르는 전류에 의해 발생되는 자계의\n\n방향을 결정하는 법칙은?\n\n\n① 암페어의 오른나사 법칙\n\n② 암페어의 주회적분 법칙\n\n③ 플레밍의 오른손 법칙\n\n④ 플레밍의 왼손 법칙\n\n⑤ 렌츠의 법칙","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":545},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m06-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1175}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n평행판 콘덴서의 전극판의 면적을 2배, 전극판간의 간격을\n\n2배로 하는 경우, 정전용량은 기존에 비해 어떻게 되는가?\n\n\n① 배가 된다.      ② 배가 된다.\n③ 배가 된다.     ④ 배가 된다.                               \n\n⑤ 변화가 없다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":674},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":707}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n전계가 Vm일 때,\n\n점 (1, 1, 2)에서 는?\n\n\n① 13          ② 18\n\n③ 21          ④ 25\n\n⑤ 36","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":568},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m08-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n유전율이 Fm인 매질내의 전하 C에서 발산되는\n\n전기력선 수는?\n\n\n             \n①             ②                                    \n\n             \n③           ④                                  \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":641},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m09-e1.webp","width":678,"height":830}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n전하량이 C인 점전하로부터 3m 떨어진 거리에서\n의 전속밀도는 몇 Cm인가?\n\n\n① 0.2          ② 0.5\n\n③ 1.0          ④ 1.5\n\n⑤ 2.5","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":607},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m10-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1052}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n인덕턴스가 H 인 코일에 전류     sinA를 흘                                         \n릴 때, 코일에 축적되는 에너지의 최댓값J은?\n\n\n                                            \n①                                      ②     \n\n                                           \n③                                      ④     \n\n             \n⑤         ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":668},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m11-e1.webp","width":696,"height":992}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n콘덴서의 직병렬 접속에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 직렬접속시 정전용량이 작을수록 전압이 크게 걸린다.\n\n② 직렬접속시 총 전하량은 각 콘덴서의 전하량과 같다.\n\n③ 직렬접속시 합성 정전용량은 커진다.\n\n④ 병렬접속시 총 전하량은 각 콘덴서의 전하량의 합과\n\n  같다.\n\n⑤ 병렬접속시 합성 정전용량은 각 콘덴서의 정전용량의\n\n  합과 같다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":608},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m12-e1.webp","width":696,"height":890}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n유전율 Fm, Fm인 매질이 나란히 접해있고, 유\n전율 Fm인 매질에서 전계가 입사하여 입사각이 ,\n\n굴절각이 일 때, 경계조건에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은\n\n것은?\n\n\n① 전계는 수평성분(접선성분)이 같다.\n\n② 전속밀도는 수직성분(법선성분이)이 같다.\n\n③ 굴절법칙은                  표현된다.   tantan  으로\n\n④ 경계면에서 두 매질의 전위는 서로 같다.\n⑤ 인 경우, 의 관계가 성립한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":742},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m13-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1050}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n서로 다른 이종 금속을 접합하여 폐회로를 형성하고 전류\n\n를 흘리면 각 접합점에서 열의 흡수와 열의 발생이 일어남\n\n을 나타내는 용어는?\n\n\n① 제벡 효과       ② 펠티에 효과\n\n③ 톰슨 효과       ④ 압전 효과\n\n⑤ 초전 효과","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m14-e1.webp","width":678,"height":832},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m14-e2.webp","width":696,"height":921}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n14°C의 물 50L를 30분 동안 100°C로 가열하기 위\n\n해 필요한 전열기의 소비전력은 몇 kW인가?\n\n(단, 효율은 0.9이다.)\n\n\n① 8.2          ② 10.8\n\n③ 11.1             ④ 15.8\n\n⑤ 22.8","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":538},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m15-e1.webp","width":696,"height":963}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n전기회로와 자기회로를 비교한 것으로 옳은 사항을 모두\n\n고른 것은?\n\n  ㉠ 전류 – 자류      ㉡ 기전력 - 기자력\n\n  ㉢ 전계 – 자계      ㉣ 도전율 - 유전율\n\n  ㉤ 전기저항 - 자기저항\n\n\n\n① ㉠㉡㉢        ② ㉡㉢㉤\n\n③ ㉢㉣㉤        ④ ㉠㉡㉢㉤\n\n⑤ ㉠㉡㉢㉣㉤","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":742},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m16-e1.webp","width":678,"height":980}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n자기력선의 성질에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 자기력선의 접선방향은 자계의 방향이다.\n\n② 자기력선 밀도는 자계의 세기와 같다.\n\n③ 진공중의 의 자하에서 형성되는 자기력선 수는\n\n  개이다.\n\n④ 자기력선은 도체면에 수직으로 작용한다.\n\n⑤ 자기력선은 N극에서 시작하여 S극에서 끝난다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":604},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m17-e1.webp","width":678,"height":897},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m17-e2.webp","width":696,"height":654}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n전류가 흐르는 무한 직선도체로부터 2m 떨어진 점의\n\n자계가 200Am였다. 도체로부터 5m 떨어진 곳의\n\n자계는 몇 Am인가?\n\n\n① 50          ② 80\n\n③ 160         ④ 400\n\n⑤ 500","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":537},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m18-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1230}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n전자가 자기장내에 수직으로 입사하게 되면 원운동을\n\n하게 된다. 이 경우, 원운동 반경에 대한 설명으로 옳은\n\n것은?\n\n\n① 원운동 반경은 자계의 세기에 비례한다.\n\n② 원운동 반경은 전하량에 비례한다.\n\n③ 원운동 반경은 입사속도에 비례한다.\n\n④ 원운동 반경은 전속밀도에 비례한다.\n\n⑤ 원운동 반경은 전자의 질량에 반비례한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":723},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m19-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1367}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n자화된 강차성체가 고온이 되면서 자기적인 성질을 잃고\n\n상자성체와 같이 될 때, 이 온도를 무엇이라 하는가?\n\n\n① 켈빈온도       ② 퀴리온도\n\n③ 연화온도       ④ 전이온도\n\n⑤ 이화온도","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m20-e1.webp","width":678,"height":515}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n무한장 솔레노이드의 외부자계에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것\n\n은?\n\n\n① 솔레노이드의 내부자계와 세기가 같다.\n\n② 솔레노이드에 흐르는 전류에 비례한다.\n\n③ 솔레노이드의 권수에 비례한다.\n\n④ 솔레노이드의 내부자계의 2배 크게 나타난다.\n\n⑤ 솔레노이드의 외부자계는 존재하지 않는다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m21-q.webp","width":678,"height":517},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m21-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1042}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n유전율이 Fm, 투자율이 Fm인 자유공간상에서\n\n의 특성임피던스Ω는?\n\n\n                            \n①             ②                                     \n                                        \n③                  ④  \n         \n⑤  ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m22-e1.webp","width":696,"height":840}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n맥스웰 전자 방정식의 구성으로 옳은 것은?\n\n                         \n             \n ①                                            \n             \n ②                                              \n             \n ③                                            \n             \n ④                                               \n             \n ⑤                                               ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":695},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m23-e1.webp","width":678,"height":935}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n극판 간격이 m인 평행판 콘덴서에 Fm의 유전체를\n삽입한 경우의 변위전류는 몇 A인가?\n\n\n① cos      ② sin\n③ tan      ④ cos\n⑤ sin","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m24-q.webp","width":696,"height":505},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m24-e1.webp","width":678,"height":947}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P040-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\n도체수 , 전류  , 자기저항 , 자계의 세기 , 투자율\n\n, 단면적 , 자로의 길이 일 때, 기자력 관계식으로 옳\n\n지 않은 것은?\n\n\n  \n①        ②            \n\n                     ∅\n③           ④        \n⑤ ∅","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.16 서울시설공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h1-e19-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m25-q.webp","width":678,"height":720},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e19-m25-e1.webp","width":696,